The '''Mayonnaise Machine''' is a type of [[Crafting#Artisan Equipment|Artisan Equipment]] used to make [[Artisan Goods]].  It takes eggs and turns them into various kinds of [[Mayonnaise]].

==Products==
:''See also: [[Animal Products Profitability]]''
Regular white or brown chicken [[egg]]s produce normal quality Mayonnaise, and [[Large Egg|Large white or brown chicken eggs]] produce gold-quality mayonnaise. A single [[Ostrich Egg]] will produce 10 jars of Mayonnaise, with the quality of the Mayonnaise equal to the quality of the Ostrich Egg used. A [[Golden Egg]] will produce three gold-quality Mayonnaise.

